WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.730
<b>That's an actual ending.</b>

00:01.840 --> 00:03.310
<b>Yes- or was it?</b>

00:03.410 --> 00:04.460
<b>Was it?</b>

00:04.570 --> 00:06.040
<b>Maybe not.</b>

00:08.880 --> 00:12.840
<b>Maybe the point is
to have the viewers yell out,</b>

00:13.450 --> 00:15.780
<b>''We don't care!''</b>

00:24.160 --> 00:27.320
<b>All of these images were
originally Koge-Donbo images</b>

00:27.430 --> 00:29.660
<b>that the animators re-created, right?</b>

00:29.770 --> 00:32.930
<b>For the anime opening sequences,</b>

00:33.040 --> 00:38.980
<b>they made them using
Koge-Donbo's illustrations.</b>

00:40.440 --> 00:42.810
<b>They're not being lazy
or anything, right?</b>

00:42.910 --> 00:44.940
<b>I don't think so.</b>

00:45.580 --> 00:47.950
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

00:48.050 --> 00:52.450
<b>This is the first episode where
Puchiko is the main character.</b>

00:53.060 --> 00:55.420
<b>For this series,</b>

00:55.530 --> 01:00.260
<b>director Sakurai wrote
all of the storyboards up to this point.</b>

01:00.360 --> 01:05.860
<b>But this episode's storyboard
was written by Tatsuo Sato,</b>

01:06.370 --> 01:10.470
<b>who's the director of''Nadesico''</b>

01:11.070 --> 01:14.370
<b>and ''Stellvia.''</b>

01:15.280 --> 01:19.480
<b>I remember being surprised about
the art of the storyboard.</b>

01:19.580 --> 01:23.040
<b>Not that it was bad,
but the style was different.</b>

01:26.460 --> 01:30.950
<b>Was he asked
to write a Puchiko episode?</b>

01:31.060 --> 01:36.970
<b>I'm not sure, but it was probably
the director who asked.</b>

01:40.200 --> 01:43.760
<b>But this episode created
a lot of Puchiko fans.</b>

01:43.870 --> 01:46.000
<b>I'm sure it did in the U.S. too.</b>

01:46.110 --> 01:50.210
<b>Originally we didn't have any idea about
anything coming out of Puchiko's eyes.</b>

01:50.310 --> 01:52.280
<b>This was an anime original too.</b>

02:01.890 --> 02:05.190
<b>Dejiko is slowly becoming
an awful person.</b>

02:27.780 --> 02:30.120
<b>This is the first time
they're in PJs.</b>

02:30.220 --> 02:31.240
<b>That's right.</b>

02:32.190 --> 02:34.420
<b>Even her PJs have cat ears.</b>

02:34.520 --> 02:35.790
<b>It's really cute.</b>

02:35.890 --> 02:37.760
<b>PJs with cat ears.</b>

02:37.860 --> 02:39.920
<b>It is cute.</b>

02:41.300 --> 02:43.060
<b>What's with the ice cream cone?</b>

02:43.170 --> 02:45.000
<b>It's Gema's house.</b>

02:45.100 --> 02:47.730
<b>It's where he sleeps.</b>

02:47.840 --> 02:49.810
<b>Although it's hard to tell
where he sleeps on it.</b>

02:49.910 --> 02:55.670
<b>I think it's revealed later, though.</b>

02:55.780 --> 02:56.750
<b>That's right.</b>

02:56.850 --> 02:58.750
<b>There's a vast world in there.</b>

02:58.850 --> 03:01.720
<b>I think it's later in the specials.</b>

03:06.890 --> 03:09.950
<b>Puchiko also ended up being a character
that sleeps against the wall.</b>

03:10.060 --> 03:11.750
<b>That's true.</b>

03:22.670 --> 03:24.500
<b>It's nice that they eat simple meals.</b>

03:25.440 --> 03:27.570
<b>They look really poor.</b>

03:41.820 --> 03:44.920
<b>This episode really shows</b>
